commit 312d49c4450f6dfed96e58e346a77441a7bb155d

C03: a colour is not the label of a control; the click asks which button (UI1639)

«hace click en el boton rojo» reached input.visible.click with the label «rojo», which no control carries: the product finds controls by their visible text, never by colour. A click whose only label is a colour is now an explicit clarification of input.visible.click with the label pending — zero operations — so the turn asks for the button's text instead of failing a click.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


